Changes since v1:
  - Reworked to use the generic riscv-fusion.cc table instead of a
    separate arcv.cc with a monolithic arcv_macro_fusion_pair_p; each
    pair is now an individual riscv_fuse_* checker.
  - Replaced the single RISCV_FUSE_ARCV umbrella flag with per-pair
    RISCV_FUSE_* flags, enabled via the RHX-100 tune_info fusible_ops.
  - Reuse the existing RISCV_FUSE_BFEXT and RISCV_FUSE_LUI_LD checkers
    instead of the custom shift-bitextract / load+lui logic from v1.
  - Restructured the v1 memop+arith / memop+lui helpers into the more
    specific LS_UPDATE, LUI_ST and LUI_LD_REV checkers.
  - Dropped the config.gcc / t-riscv / arcv.o plumbing (no new file).
  - Added 12 dump-scan tests (none in v1).
